WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:20.919 --> 00:00:25.730
emocratic presidential candidates had their
final debate last night for four Saturdays,

00:00:25.730 --> 00:00:28.029
South South Carolina

00:00:28.029 --> 00:00:34.909
primary, and then also the last debate before
Tuesday's March 3rd super Tuesday, a contest,

00:00:34.909 --> 00:00:40.649
